WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Ryu falls from the prerequisite forward throw.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.050
Kimberly spends one Drive bar to reach wake-up range.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.600
Standing medium punch hits the waking Ryu.

4
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Crouching medium punch links into the medium target.

5
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.150
Sprint slide completes the conversion.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.450
Ryu falls after the slide.
